      "UsedFor": "Confirming the base URL / resource-oriented path convention (https://api.stripe.com/v1/<resource>) and the global HTTP bearer security scheme used for API-key auth.",
      "SourceTier": 1,
      "SourceCategory": "OpenAPISpec",
      "EvidenceStrength": "ExplicitStatement",
      "TargetField": "integration.NavigationBaseURL",
      "Excerpt": "servers: [{url: 'https://api.stripe.com/v1'}]; all 414 paths are relative to this server root (e.g. /customers, /charges, /payment_intents); components.securitySchemes declares an HTTP bearer scheme applied globally."
    },
    {
      "URL": "https://docs.stripe.com/api",
      "AccessedAt": "2026-07-02T19:00:00.000Z",
      "UsedFor": "Confirming the Stripe-Version header pins the API version per-request, overriding the key's account-default pinned version.",
      "SourceTier": 1,
      "SourceCategory": "OfficialDocs",
      "EvidenceStrength": "ExplicitStatement",
      "TargetField": "integration.Configuration.AuthAdditionalHeaders",
      "Excerpt": "Versioning section: requests may pin a specific API version by sending the Stripe-Version header; omitting it uses the version associated with the API key's account settings at request time."
    }
